    <statement><p>Find the solution to the recurrence relation <m>a_n = -3a_{n-1} + 10a_{n-2}</m> with initial terms <m>a_0 = {2}</m> and <m>a_1 = {-3}\text{.}</m></p>
<p><m>a_n =</m> <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2^{n}+\left(-5\right)^{n}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>By the characteristic root technique. <m>a_n = {2^{n}+\left(-5\right)^{n}}\text{.}</m></p>
</solution>
